Error [jet.FenceNotAllowed]: Fences are allowed only in a binding target or an expression statement
  --> tests/ui/fenced_name_bad_position.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     if <: first, second :> {
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A fence expands complete binding or expression statements, not headers, items, or nested syntax
 Fix: Move the fence to a binding target or a complete expression statement
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0371
